==Strategy==
Due to the buffs on the General GreGories, it is recommended to have all [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] from all three chapters of [[Cats of the Cosmos]].

Compared to the other stages in Resident Undead, this is a extremely hard Zombie stage that is designed to completely overwhelm you hard and fast, with magnifications comparable to UL. With multiple Zir Zeals, three Zapies that appear extremely close to each other, a Zamelle nuking all of your units, and Zang Roos, combined with the low stage length, you should only try this stage if your units are properly boosted, and if your Holy Blast is at a decently high level.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]]: The quintessential anti-Zombie meatshield. Shigong's extremely high health allows him to tank multiple hits from the combined Zombie threat, and cleans up Zamelle very well. Note that unless Talented, Shigong can get warped by Zapy, and that if the enemy force is too strong Shigong won't last very long.
*[[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]]: Cadaver's extremely high damage against Zombies makes him the perfect unit for the Zuches or Zrocos, though a lot of enemies here do outrange him.
*[[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]]: A unit similar to Cadaver BearCat, but less accessible. Does have Soulstrike to clean up corpses as well as enough standing range to properly hit Zang Roo and Zir Zeal.
*[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]: High damage attacker against the GreGories and Kroxos. Can Can's Double Bounty Talent allows Can Can to earn a lot of cash from revived Zombies or GreGories.
*[[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]: Housewife's high range and Zombie Killer lets her kill off the Zrocos and strike a Savage Blow for very high damage when Talented.
*[[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]]: Seafarer not only works for GreGory, but also has a fair bit of damage for the Zombie horde.
*[[Miyamoku Musashi (Special Cat)|Awakened Musashi]]: If you don't have anti-Zombie Ubers, Musashi is great here as an anti-Zombie backliner.

